# Runtime artifacts written by the vendored ASB loop (aios/pyopenagi) when this
# claim's tests instantiate and run the ASB target. They land relative to the
# current working directory and must never be committed.
#
# - aios/        : context restoration files + per-agent file storage
# - logs/        : scheduler / agents / llm_kernel log files
# - memory_db/   : default chroma_db vector store
aios/
logs/
memory_db/
*context_restoration*
